PROVENANCE.md records the nnnoiseless package and the weights file.

With the `dfn3` feature, this crate runs the DeepFilterNet3 model (low-latency variant), from
DeepFilterNet (https://github.com/Rikorose/DeepFilterNet), and src/dfn3/stream.rs is ported
from libDF's src/lib.rs and src/tract.rs at commit 978576aa8400552a4ce9730838c635aa30db5e61,
under MIT OR Apache-2.0:
    Copyright (c) 2021 Hendrik Schröter
    Licensed under either of the MIT license or the Apache License, Version 2.0, at your option.
DeepFilterNet is the work of Hendrik Schröter and the DeepFilterNet authors.
The model weights are not in this crate. An app that ships them ships, beside them, their
NOTICE (which marks the converted archive as converted by Alakazam Labs) and the MIT and
Apache-2.0 texts; PROVENANCE.md says where they come from.
